# CODEOWNERS — per-bundle review ownership (governance idea #16)
#
# GitHub requests a review from the owner(s) of any changed path. At 1,170+
# skills across 130+ bundles, one reviewer is a throughput and bus-factor
# risk; this file lets trusted co-maintainers own the bundles they know.
#
# Today every path resolves to the maintainer. As co-maintainers join
# (see MAINTAINERS.md), add a line per bundle ABOVE the catch-all — later
# lines win, so specific bundle rules must come after the default.

# Default: everything
